            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1001</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo confronto stampa <code>True</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code> è maggiore di <code>1</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il segno <code>&gt;</code> rende uguali due numeri qualsiasi.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I due numeri vengono uniti per formare <code>1001</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>100</code> è maggiore di <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
