            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifica se <code>11</code> è maggiore o uguale a <code>11</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I due numeri sono uguali. Costruisci l'operatore che stampa <code>True</code> qui e anche se il numero a sinistra fosse maggiore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
