            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salva il risultato del confronto con <code>min_score</code> nella variabile <code>pass</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"32\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"min_score = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = score &gt;= min_score\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"60\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pass</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e poi <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>min_score</code>.</p></body></html>",
