            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa viene visualizzato nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>False</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>True</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NinaNina</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>False</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo confronto con <code>!=</code> stampa <code>False</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" != \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"False\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Entrambe le stringhe hanno lo stesso valore, <code>Nina</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>!=</code> verifica se le stringhe sono uguali.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I valori di testo non possono essere confrontati con <code>!=</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Entrambe le stringhe hanno lo stesso valore, <code>Nina</code>.</p></body></html>"
